{"seq":15,"slug":"event-driven-architecture","title":"事件驱动架构","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture","rating":{"composite":4.08,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"事件驱动架构\">事件驱动架构</h1><p>事件驱动架构（Event-Driven Architecture, EDA）将系统间的交互从「请求-响应」的同步调用转变为「产生事件-订阅事件-反应事件」的异步协作模式。在 2026 年的云原生生态中，Kafka 4.0 彻底移除 ZooKeeper 依赖、AsyncAPI 3.1 成为事件契约标准、CloudEvents v1.0 统一了事件信封格式——这三项进展让 EDA 从「架构理念」真正落地为「工程标准」。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦于事件驱动架构本身的设计原则、消息基础设施、核心模式与生产运维。它与同类 hub 的分工边界如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>微服务架构</strong>（<code>04_microservices-architecture</code>）讨论服务拆分策略、API Gateway、Saga 等通用微服务模式——本 hub 专注于「事件」作为一等公民的通信与状态管理范式，是对微服务间异步通信的深入展开。</li>\n<li><strong>Service Mesh</strong>（<code>14_service-mesh</code>）解决服务间网络层的流量管理、mTLS 安全与可观测代理——本 hub 的 Event Mesh 是应用层的事件路由网络，两者互补但层次不同。</li>\n<li><strong>可观测性工程</strong>（<code>05_observability-engineering</code>）提供通用的 Metrics/Traces/Logs 三支柱框架——本 hub 的运维章节讨论 EDA 特有的可观测挑战（事件延迟 SLI、Dead Letter Queue 监控、跨服务因果追踪）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>对于有 3-5 年分布式系统经验的后端工程师，推荐按以下顺序阅读：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>基础篇</strong>：理解事件的本质、EDA 拓扑模式、最终一致性的理论基础。</li>\n<li><strong>消息篇</strong>：掌握 Kafka 4.0 KRaft 架构、主流消息代理选型、Schema Registry 与 CloudEvents 标准化。</li>\n<li><strong>模式篇</strong>：深入 Event Sourcing + CQRS、Outbox Pattern + CDC、Saga 编舞三大核心实现模式。</li>\n<li><strong>运维篇</strong>：学习 AsyncAPI 契约治理、Event Mesh 路由拓扑、以及 DLQ/重试/可观测性的生产级运维。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>如果已熟悉 Kafka 基础但尚未接触 Event Sourcing，可直接从模式篇入手，遇到概念空缺时回查基础篇对应文档。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>分布式系统基本概念（CAP 定理、网络分区、幂等性）</li>\n<li>微服务通信基础（同步 RPC vs 异步消息队列）</li>\n<li>至少使用过一种消息中间件（Kafka / RabbitMQ / Pulsar 均可）</li>\n<li>了解数据库事务与一致性模型（ACID vs BASE）</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"事件驱动基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"event-driven-fundamentals","title":"事件驱动基础概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/foundations/event-driven-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"event-types-and-topology","title":"事件类型与拓扑模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/foundations/event-types-and-topology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"eventual-consistency","title":"最终一致性与 CAP 权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/foundations/eventual-consistency"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"messaging","title":"消息基础设施","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/messaging","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"kafka-kraft-architecture","title":"Kafka 4.0 与 KRaft 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/messaging/kafka-kraft-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"message-broker-comparison","title":"消息代理选型对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/messaging/message-broker-comparison"},{"seq":3,"slug":"schema-registry-cloudevents","title":"Schema Registry 与 CloudEvents 标准化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/messaging/schema-registry-cloudevents"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"patterns","title":"核心设计模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"event-sourcing-cqrs","title":"Event Sourcing 与 CQRS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/patterns/event-sourcing-cqrs"},{"seq":2,"slug":"outbox-pattern-cdc","title":"Outbox Pattern 与 CDC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/patterns/outbox-pattern-cdc"},{"seq":3,"slug":"saga-choreography","title":"Saga 编排与事件编舞","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/patterns/saga-choreography"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"生产运维","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"asyncapi-contract-governance","title":"AsyncAPI 契约治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/operations/asyncapi-contract-governance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"event-mesh-routing","title":"Event Mesh 与事件路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/operations/event-mesh-routing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"observability-dlq-resilience","title":"可观测性与容错运维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/operations/observability-dlq-resilience"}]}]}